  "result": "Excellent! All tests pass. I've successfully created:\n\n## `src/reports.js`\nThe `overdueInvoices(invoices, asOf)` function that:\n- Filters invoices with status `'issued'` or `'partially_paid'`\n- Keeps only those with `dueDate` before the `asOf` reference date\n- Returns an array of `{ number, customerId, dueDate, daysOverdue, due }` objects\n- Sorts results by `daysOverdue` descending (most overdue first)\n- Calculates `daysOverdue` using `daysBetween()` and `due` using `balanceDue()`\n\n## `test/reports.test.js`\n17 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Basic functionality with issued and partially paid invoices\n- Status filtering (excluding draft and paid invoices)\n- Date filtering (excluding not-yet-due and same-day due invoices)\n- Sorting by overdue days\n- Due amount calculation with VAT and discounts\n- Multiple payment handling\n- Edge cases (empty arrays, no mutations, old due dates)\n\nAll 181 tests in the test suite pass.",
